{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02916","headline":"落成会咏一首 · 陈元光","name":"落成会咏一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泉潮天万里，一镇屹天中。\n筮宅龙锺地，承恩燕翼宫。\n环堂巍岳秀，带砺大江雄。\n轮奂云霄望，晶华日月通。\n凌烟乔木茂，献宝介圭崇。\n昆俊歌常棣，民和教即戎。\n盘庚迁美士，陶侃效兼庸。\n设醴延张老，开轩礼吕蒙。\n无孤南国仰，庶补圣皇功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}